          "The experimental system, illustrated in Fig. 3, comprises a real-time simulation of the AR phenomenon, along with a 3D computer graphics interface and a force-feedback device."@en .

  mlann:HapticTechnologyAnnotation
      a oa:Annotation, prov:Entity ;
      rdfs:label "Scanning-probe haptic-interface coding of Millet et al. (2013)"@en ;
      oa:motivatedBy oa:classifying ;
      oa:hasBody feat:ScanningProbeHaptics ;
      oa:hasTarget mlann:HapticTechnologyTarget ;
      dct:description
          "The code concerns the force-feedback interface used to render the simulated AFM tip-sample interaction."@en ;
